[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6255.669, "timestamp": "01:44:15", "text": "No, wait. Uh, honestly though, this"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6258.95, "timestamp": "01:44:18", "text": "feels like the day I learned what LGBTQ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6261.59, "timestamp": "01:44:21", "text": "was. I was streaming like this back in"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6265.189, "timestamp": "01:44:25", "text": "2019. Random person came into my chat"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6268.39, "timestamp": "01:44:28", "text": "and uh ask me, \"Are you gay or"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6270.47, "timestamp": "01:44:30", "text": "something? Are you part of the LGBT"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6273.03, "timestamp": "01:44:33", "text": "community?\" I was like, \"Huh? What is"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6277.43, "timestamp": "01:44:37", "text": "what is LGBTQ plus?\" and stuff."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6280.39, "timestamp": "01:44:40", "text": "And I Googled it. That's how I learned"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6283.75, "timestamp": "01:44:43", "text": "all these different genders people have"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6288.47, "timestamp": "01:44:48", "text": "or something. And holy lord, I was"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6291.75, "timestamp": "01:44:51", "text": "surprised and"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6297.43, "timestamp": "01:44:57", "text": "What [laughter]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6299.75, "timestamp": "01:44:59", "text": "sandwich of"}]